      "text": "--> Artifacts authoring syntax :\n\n        ° 2 forms of artifact authroing syntax for components :\n\n                - Traditional Artifact Syntax\n\n                - Pythonic Artifact Syntax\n\n        ° 1 form of artifact authoring syntax for pipelines :\n                \n                - Pythonic Artifact Syntax",
